 "critic": "All read as plausibly assembled from parts: interchangeable names, repeated full names in short instructions, three-option menus in personal messages, and endings explaining why V was selected. Several switch abruptly from third-person reporting to first-person speech. The weakest causal links assume an organized plot because a thief was unfamiliar, or offer paying the victim as an alternative to investigating. The strongest hooks connect an existing pressure to a consequence: injury threatens work, protection money comes due, and refusing a collector risks escalation. H-073 adds collective resistance, giving the district something underway before V arrives."
